稽典录曰：牧次子盛，亦履恭让，为尚书郎。弟徇领兵为将，拜偏将军，戍西陵，与监军使者唐盛论地形势，谓宜城、信陵为建平援，若不先城，敌将先入。盛以施绩、留平，智略名将，屡经於彼，無云當城之者，不然徇计。后半年，晋果遣将脩信陵城。晋军平吴，徇领水军督，临陈战死。","source_term":"牧次子盛"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-wu060-zhonglimu-2","interpretation_note":"本句所記父子；識別後綴不表示長幼。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}},{"id":"ydn_6em_dn7","label":"鍾離徇〔鍾離盛弟〕","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","review":"ai_provisional","aliases":[{"surface":"徇","mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu:line099-pei01-01:m0022","c-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu:line099-pei01-01:m0097","c-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu:line099-pei01-01:m0118"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-060","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu:line099-pei01-01","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu:line099-pei01-01:m0022","quote":"徇"},{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-060","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu:line099-pei01-01","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu:line099-pei01-01:m0097","quote":"徇"},{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-060","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu:line099-pei01-01","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu:line099-pei01-01:m0118","quote":"徇"}],"identity_note":"依本篇具名、稱謂及其所在原句辨認；引書原字存於各自來源。"}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-060","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu:line099-pei01-01:m0009"],"paragraph_ids":["c-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu:line099-pei01-01"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu:line099-pei01-01:m0009","mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu:line099-pei01-01:m0009"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"dupli